   ],
   "facts": [
    "Shortly before 23:00 Kyiv time on Sunday, Ukraine's Air Alert app sent nationwide red-level air raid warnings.",
    "Some users, including in Kyiv, also got fake warnings of radiation, chemical attacks and street fighting.",
