    "A few hours later Russian authorities said their own alert app had been hacked.",
    "A Ukrainian espionage group claimed it had sent fake warnings of nuclear strikes to users inside Russia.",
    "Ukrainian officials blamed a failure in the app and urged people to rely on other sources of information."
